    <h2>Conclusion</h2>

    <p>
        Email marketing automation allows businesses to send relevant
        messages automatically based on subscriber actions, conditions,
        and events.
    </p>

    <p>
        Beginners can start with simple workflows such as welcome
        sequences, educational campaigns, abandoned cart reminders,
        post-purchase emails, and re-engagement campaigns.
    </p>

    <p>
        The key to successful automation is to provide useful content,
        use appropriate timing, test workflows carefully, respect
        subscriber preferences, and regularly review performance.
    </p>

